research institute should work to create a culture&nbsp;
that actively supports open science by design and&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:26.560 --> 00:09:30.960
reproducibility is part of that so what are these&nbsp;
values that i talk about well the first should be&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:31.840 --> 00:09:36.000
objectivity right which basically means&nbsp;
we want to get the answers right and one&nbsp;&nbsp;

