objectivity is a complex concept in the philosophy&nbsp;
of science and one one way that i like that people&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:42.080 --> 00:09:46.960
talk about it is in terms of minimizing what&nbsp;
you might think of as epistemic risk the risk&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:46.960 --> 00:09:54.240
of having incorrect knowledge um another value&nbsp;
is community you know we think that science&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:54.240 --> 00:09:59.120
should be a communal rather than a competitive&nbsp;
endeavor third is respect that the community&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:59.120 --> 00:10:04.400
should be open and inclusive and respect the&nbsp;
contributions and positionality of each individual&nbsp;&nbsp;

