fourth is humility we have to acknowledge the&nbsp;
fact that we're humans and everything we do has&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:09.280 --> 00:10:13.200
biases and limitations and then there's also&nbsp;
constraints on the generality of our work&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:14.000 --> 00:10:20.400
fifth value is openness our work should be&nbsp;
available to others to reproduce and use and um&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:20.400 --> 00:10:24.320
six is transparency our work should be clear and&nbsp;
understandable to others so then the question is&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:25.200 --> 00:10:31.680
how do we turn those values into principles um&nbsp;
now you might be asking why is he talking about&nbsp;&nbsp;

